        },
        "subject": "LU-20642 tests: use FSNAME in conf-sanity 108 helpers",
        "message": "LU-20642 tests: use FSNAME in conf-sanity 108 helpers\n\nt_108_mkfs() formats with --fsname=lustre and t_108_check() mounts\n${nid}:/lustre, but test_108b() calls replace_nids with\n$FSNAME-MDT0000. Those targets do not exist unless FSNAME is\n\"lustre\".\n\nLU-11490 made this change elsewhere and missed these two.\n\nFixes: a6fb2bbe71 (\"LU-10193 tests: test migration between ldiskfs and zfs\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=conf-sanity env=ONLY=108\nSigned-off-by: Robert Read <rread@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I3b7ed7e5ba8612715b2208551f1e21defb0f4330\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
